<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch adds Henderson Inv warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds Henderson Inv warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said it would issue an additional 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Henderson Investment Ltd, bringing the issue up to a total 700 million warrants.</p>
<p>Terms remain unchanged. Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.88	PREMIUM	 6.51 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.228     GEARING	 3.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  31.DEC.97    PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$8.60</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
